.TH Num.sin 3 2026-08-27 "Tomo man-pages"
.SH NAME
Num.sin \- sine
.SH LIBRARY
Tomo Standard Library
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.BI Num.sin\ :\ func(x:\ Num\ ->\ Num)
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The sine of an angle in radians.


.SH ARGUMENTS

.TS
allbox;
lb lb lbx
l l l.
Name	Type	Description
x	Num	The angle in radians. 
.TE
.SH RETURN
The sine of `x`.

.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
assert (0.).sin() == 0
assert Num.PI.sin() == 0
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR Tomo-Num (3)
